# Android signing secrets — НИКОГДА в git (guard для будущих файлов).
# Существующий keystore/urtruck-release.keystore уже в истории — вынести
# из репо и сбросить upload key отдельно (см. RELEASE_SIGNING.md).
*.keystore
*.jks
*.p12
!android/app/debug.keystore
upload_certificate.pem
keystore/
credentials.json
*.aab
google-play-service-account.json

# Android Firebase/FCM config — the real file (real UrTruck project, NOT the
# accidentally-committed BizChat one removed in the same change that added
# this line, see docs/release/android-firebase-config.md) is materialized
# at build time by build-android-apk.yml / deploy-play.yml from the
# ANDROID_GOOGLE_SERVICES_JSON_BASE64 repository secret. It must never be
# committed — a committed file here is exactly the class of incident this
# fix closes (a real credential, and worse, a silently WRONG one, sitting in
# git history where nothing forces it to match the real project).
/google-services.json
/android/app/google-services.json

# Claude Code harness runtime state (PID/timestamp, session-local — не версионируется)
.claude/scheduled_tasks.lock

# Рабочие папки с сертификатами Play Console — не должны попасть в git
ключи для play console/
Проверь пж/
